	(descr "8 x 6 mm 8-pad SPI NAND, 1.27 mm pitch, shared land for Micron MT29F2G01ABAGDWB (U-PDFN-8 code WB, datasheet Rev. F figure 38: terminals 0.4 x 0.4 at the body edge) and Winbond W25N02KVZE (WSON-8 8x6 code ZE, Rev. G 11.1: b 0.40, L 0.50, EP D2 3.40 x E2 4.30, not connected). Pins on the two 6 mm edges, columns 8 mm apart. Signal lands 0.45 x 0.85 at x +/-3.875 (3.45..4.30) cover both terminal lengths with 0.3 mm toe. Pad 9 is the Winbond EP land, no paste, grounded; nothing routes under the part.")
